{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/021-mantle/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"4de2cc84-af9d-593c-a193-b45a9cae93f0","excerpt":"A new stone fireplace became the focal point of the den, but it lacked a proper mantle. A floating walnut shelf would add warmth (figuratively) and give us a…","html":"<p>A new stone fireplace became the focal point of the den, but it lacked a proper mantle. A floating walnut shelf would add warmth (figuratively) and give us a place to display photos and seasonal decorations.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/a878e/glue_up.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Glue Up\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/f058b/glue_up.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/c26ae/glue_up.png 158w,\n/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/6bdcf/glue_up.png 315w,\n/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/f058b/glue_up.png 630w,\n/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/40601/glue_up.png 945w,\n/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/78612/glue_up.png 1260w,\n/static/85d7f9d3e3bacb2affd017c37c2eb868/a878e/glue_up.png 2048w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Wide walnut boards were joined and clamped. The grain was carefully matched so the seams would nearly disappear. Getting boards this wide and long flat and true took some patience with the jointer and planer, but you could probably drive a truck across that thing in the end.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/71c1d/installed.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Installed\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/f058b/installed.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/c26ae/installed.png 158w,\n/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/6bdcf/installed.png 315w,\n/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/f058b/installed.png 630w,\n/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/40601/installed.png 945w,\n/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/78612/installed.png 1260w,\n/static/b76404cfc6cb0d7301b5e7b4d36044a1/71c1d/installed.png 1536w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The finished mantle floats above the stacked stone. The walnut’s rich brown tones complement the gray stone beautifully, and the natural edge on the front adds organic character.</p>\n<p>A good mantle transforms a fireplace from a feature into a focal point. This one will hold pumpkins in the fall, stockings in winter, and memories year-round.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Mantle","date":"June 16, 2019","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/022-more-adirondacks/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"More Adirondacks"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/023-ski-racer-table/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Ski Racer Table"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"4de2cc84-af9d-593c-a193-b45a9cae93f0","previousPostId":"8c09a396-28c8-5740-be2e-20fee06a2277","nextPostId":"62164557-2e27-5f7c-9b53-ebc59edad783"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}